sprite = ExtResource("2_a4yhx")
catch_blurb = "Yuri.... so beautiful...."
description = "“Ever since we were kids... I’ve always been... drawn to you...” Fairy says. Dotty inches closer to her. “Heh, I always knew it would end up like this.” Says Dotty. “W-What do you mean?”
“You’re telling me you don't feel what I feel?” Fairy looks down and touches her heart. “I didn’t say that...” Dotty locks eyes with Fairy, grabs both of her fins with a serious look on her face.
“Fairy...” “Yes...?”
Dotty hesitates for a moment
“I... I... I’M IN LOVE WITH YOU!!!!”
Dotty's purple cheeks quickly turn magenta. She holds her breath in anticipation, as she waits for Fairy's reply.
Fairy stares at Dotty in disbelief.
“Dotty... I LOVE YOU TOO!!!”
The two embrace each other the second Fairy finishes speaking.
And after all of these years... They share a long, long overdue kiss...

-Written by K. Fischer
"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cr3nmjdvpgh0a"
